(text "J101 uses physical pins 1..100 (CM4 pin minus 100).\nCM4 already AC-couples its PCIe TX and reference clock.\nFit AC capacitors only at the external controller TX.\nConnect CLK_nREQ; preserve reset control at warm boot.\n90R differential target; intrapair skew target <0.1 mm.\n\nNative USB2 is reserved for rpiboot / recovery.\nUSB_OTG_ID is left open for peripheral operation.\nThe modem USB3 path uses the PCIe controller." (at 220.98 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4df3cd81-4d09-5ad2-92d8-f498bad8398c"))
)
